;;; EXERCISE

#|
1. Make a complete documentaion of the code for 
the last exercise (exercise-texture). 

2. Make this a score for 7 different melody instruments.
Use ambitus-instrument to fit the pitches accordingly.

2. Use assign-variable to create the voices.

3. The score should be in tempo 50 in a 5/4 time-signature.

4. Convert the score into a musicxml file by using "Save As" 
in the upper left corner in the Notation Viewer.
|#

